<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2025204598"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1671745398"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="憂い桜"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="あたらよ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="憂い桜"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:35.958"><div begin="00:01.550" end="04:14.818"><p begin="00:01.550" end="00:04.000" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L1">「いつかこの景色が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“当眼前的光景</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 i tsu ka ko no ke shi ki ga</span></p><p begin="00:05.481" end="00:07.334" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L2">思い出に変わるその時<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终有一天化为回忆时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i de ni ka wa ru so no to ki</span></p><p begin="00:08.593" end="00:11.952" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L3">貴方は何を覚えていたいですか？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你希望记住什么呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wa na ni wo o bo e te i ta i de su ka ?</span></p><p begin="00:13.953" end="00:17.830" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L4">私は貴方を覚えていたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想记住关于你的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi wa a na ta wo o bo e te i ta i</span></p><p begin="00:19.352" end="00:24.019" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L5">この先もずっと、ずっと」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从今往后永远铭记”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no sa ki mo zu 't to zu 't to 」</span></p><p begin="00:40.522" end="00:43.541" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">改札を抜ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过检票口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka i sa tsu wo nu ke ru</span></p><p begin="00:43.541" end="00:48.637" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">花薫る春の風に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">满溢芬芳的春风扑面而来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na ka o ru ha ru no ka ze ni</span></p><p begin="00:48.841" end="00:52.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">心を奪われる今日<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就在今天夺走了我的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro wo u ba wa re ru kyo u</span></p><p begin="00:52.823" end="00:55.903" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">駅前の交差点<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">车站前的十字路口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e ki ma e no ko u sa te n</span></p><p begin="00:55.915" end="01:01.098" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">見慣れた景色全てが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">之所以司空见惯的光景</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi na re ta ke shi ki su be te ga</span></p><p begin="01:01.098" end="01:05.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">どこか違って見えるのは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看上去都变得有所不同</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ka chi ga 't te mi e ru no wa</span></p><p begin="01:05.003" end="01:08.026" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">代わり映えのない日常も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是因为一成不变的日常</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ri ba e no na i ni chi jo u mo</span></p><p begin="01:08.026" end="01:11.106" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">終わりが近づくといつしか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也在不知不觉中临近结束了吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o wa ri ga chi ka zu ku to i tsu shi ka</span></p><p begin="01:11.214" end="01:15.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">かけがえのないものだったのだと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我终于意识到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ke ga e no na i mo no da 't ta no da to</span></p><p begin="01:15.160" end="01:17.098" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">気づく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一切都是无可替代的珍贵存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu ku</span></p><p begin="01:18.178" end="01:23.905" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">憂うな今よ永遠に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要忧伤叹惋 此刻将会永恒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u re u na i ma yo e i e n ni</span></p><p begin="01:23.905" end="01:28.202" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">いつもよりも鮮明な世界が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比往常更加绚烂鲜艳的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo yo ri mo se n me i na se ka i ga</span></p><p begin="01:28.202" end="01:31.219" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">鮮やかに私を映す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明晰地倒映出我的身影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a za ya ka ni wa ta shi wo u tsu su</span></p><p begin="01:31.220" end="01:37.911" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">桜とてまた一年が過ぎ去れば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为即使樱花凋零 也会在一年过后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ku ra to te ma ta i chi ne n ga su gi sa re ba</span></p><p begin="01:37.911" end="01:44.044" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">同じ様にまた咲くのだから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如既往 重新绽放</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o na ji yo u ni ma ta sa ku no da ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:55.927" end="01:58.885" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">言葉一つさえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从前的我沉默而笨拙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba hi to tsu sa e</span></p><p begin="01:58.985" end="02:04.038" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">上手く紡げない日々も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至无法顺畅地说出只言片语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma ku tsu mu ge na i hi bi mo</span></p><p begin="02:04.138" end="02:08.193" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">今となっては鮮やかだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今这些回忆 也变得越发记忆犹新</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma to na 't te wa a za ya ka da</span></p><p begin="02:08.193" end="02:11.237" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">あの頃は少し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那时的我们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ko ro wa su ko shi</span></p><p begin="02:11.237" end="02:16.288" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">背伸びしていた僕らだったね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终有些逞强</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se no bi shi te i ta bo ku ra da 't ta ne</span></p><p begin="02:16.494" end="02:20.382" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">今見えている景色はほら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看 现在眼前的景色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma mi e te i ru ke shi ki wa ho ra</span></p><p begin="02:20.382" end="02:23.413" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">背伸びなんてしなくてももう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">早已无需拼尽全力逞强垫脚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se no bi na n te shi na ku te mo mo u</span></p><p begin="02:23.413" end="02:26.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">届いてるさあの日の僕に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也能够尽收眼底了 就连那天的我们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do i te ru sa a no hi no bo ku ni</span></p><p begin="02:26.652" end="02:28.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">歯痒い思い出さえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">留下的懊悔不已的回忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ga yu i o mo i de sa e</span></p><p begin="02:28.823" end="02:32.507" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">僕らの軌跡だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也化作我们成长的轨迹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra no ki se ki da</span></p><p begin="02:33.662" end="02:39.301" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">憂うな今よ永遠に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要忧伤叹惋 此刻将会永恒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u re u na i ma yo e i e n ni</span></p><p begin="02:39.301" end="02:43.545" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">いつもよりも鮮明な世界が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比往常更加绚烂鲜艳的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo yo ri mo se n me i na se ka i ga</span></p><p begin="02:43.545" end="02:46.538" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">鮮やかに私を映す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明晰地倒映出我的身影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a za ya ka ni wa ta shi wo u tsu su</span></p><p begin="02:46.670" end="02:53.308" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">桜とてまた一年が過ぎ去れば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为即使樱花凋零 也会在一年过后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ku ra to te ma ta i chi ne n ga su gi sa re ba</span></p><p begin="02:53.308" end="02:59.063" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">同じ様にまた咲くのだから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如既往 重新绽放</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o na ji yo u ni ma ta sa ku no da ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:59.063" end="03:00.558" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">いつかでいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如既往就好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka de i i</span></p><p begin="03:00.558" end="03:02.098" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">いつかでいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如既往就好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka de i i</span></p><p begin="03:02.098" end="03:03.801" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">いつかでいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如既往就好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka de i i</span></p><p begin="03:03.033" end="03:05.101" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">(変わらぬまま)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远不要改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ra nu ma ma</span></p><p begin="03:05.101" end="03:06.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">いつかまた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果终有一日</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ma ta</span></p><p begin="03:06.735" end="03:08.157" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">いつかまた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果终有一日</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ma ta</span></p><p begin="03:08.157" end="03:09.177" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">いつかまた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果终有一日</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ma ta</span></p><p begin="03:09.177" end="03:14.324" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">この場所で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还能于此重逢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ba sho de de a e ta ra</span></p><p begin="03:11.334" end="03:14.399" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">(いつかどこかで出逢えたら)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(倘若终究能于何处重逢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( i tsu ka do ko ka de de a e ta ra</span></p><p begin="03:14.399" end="03:17.447" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">(僕ら笑い合っていたいのです)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望我们能够笑着相见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra wa ra i a 't te i ta i no de su</span></p><p begin="03:15.115" end="03:19.873" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">出逢えたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若还能相遇的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra wa ra i a 't te i ta i no de su</span></p><p begin="03:17.452" end="03:22.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">(このまま何も忘れず 居たい痛い痛い)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样永远铭记一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ma ma na ni mo wa su re zu</span></p><p begin="03:22.787" end="03:28.613" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">憂うな今よ永遠に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要忧伤叹惋 此刻将会永恒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u re u na i ma yo e i e n ni</span></p><p begin="03:28.613" end="03:32.858" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">いつもどうりの何気ない日々に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请将我连同回忆 全都放逐于</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo do o ri no na ni ge na i hi bi ni</span></p><p begin="03:32.858" end="03:35.901" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">思い出と私を置いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一如既往平淡无奇的时光里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i de to wa ta shi wo o i te</span></p><p begin="03:39.299" end="03:40.972" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L51">「いつかまた」<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“有缘再见”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 i tsu ka ma ta 」</span></p><p begin="03:41.386" end="03:47.027" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">変わらないまま在る日々が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经一成不变的日常</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ra na i ma ma a ru hi bi ga</span></p><p begin="03:47.027" end="03:51.261" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">先の人生道標となる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成为指引人生方向的路标</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ki no ji n se i mi chi shi ru be to na ru</span></p><p begin="03:51.261" end="03:54.374" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">その時を願い想うのです<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我满怀期待等待那一刻到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no to ki wo ne ga i o mo u no de su</span></p><p begin="03:54.374" end="03:59.351" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">涙とてまた一年が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毕竟连悲伤的泪水 也会在一年过后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi da to te ma ta i chi ne n ga ka ki sa re ba</span></p><p begin="03:59.351" end="04:00.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">過ぎ去れば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">经过一年时光的冲刷</span></p><p begin="04:00.890" end="04:04.297" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">雨となり僕ら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">化作细雨 治愈我们的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a me to na ri bo ku ra i ya su no da ka ra</span></p><p begin="04:04.297" end="04:10.387" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">癒すのだから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将我们治愈</span></p><p begin="04:10.566" end="04:14.818" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">癒すのだから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">治愈我们的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ya su no da ka ra</span></p></div></body></tt>